      "message": "ci: pull container from ghcr.io if tag already exists\n\nIn the build-container job, check whether the image tag already exists\nin ghcr.io/riscv/udb before rebuilding from scratch. If the tag is\nfound, pull and export it directly; otherwise fall through to the\nexisting Buildx build path.\n\nThis avoids redundant multi-minute container builds on PRs that do not\ntouch the Dockerfile or container tag.",
